### H8: Piecewise-linear c1 rule and turn cancellation by c3 oscillation

WHEN c1 is held constant at a1 with the other inputs at 0, THE system SHALL end at x = -0.23*a1 for a1 > 0 and x = -0.115*a1 for a1 < 0 (within 20%), with heading about 37*a1 deg; and WHEN a 1 Hz sine of amplitude s3 = 1 is added on c3 to a1 = -1, THE system SHALL cancel most of the turn.

